    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερᾰμ-ῐκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for pottery</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ κ.</span>
			<i>potter's</i> earth, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sannyr.
				4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ῥύμη,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κεραμεικός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κέραμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).102.281
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. τροχός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					7.3.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. μάστιξ</span>, Com.Phrase for
			ostracism, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργαστήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					50.68
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>the potter's art,
				pottery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				288a
			</span></i>; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραμεικός</span>
			.</div>
